                "1,000 units",
                "2,000 units",
                "2,500 units",
                "5,000 units"
            ],
            "correct_answer_index": 2,
            "explanation": "Break-even = Fixed Costs / (Price - Variable Cost) = 50,000 / (50 - 30) = 2,500.",
            "is_past_paper": false,
            "exam_source": "AI"
